{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "152", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "20 years, a lot of progress has been made in temperature control. Basically,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.771521551309177, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a kil removes the water from clay at temperatures of around 1,000° C. This", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "allows anything you've made to set permanently in shape. It's a pretty ugly,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.7718474781373226, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "heavy object. object that's hard to keep in a house or flat, so most people", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.7713480790873393, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "don't have one. You may think, \"Can't I use my oven?\" Well, that's possible,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "but domestic ovens don't really get hot enough, and eventually the clay will", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.7722019069026258, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "crack and fall apart. Some people fire pottery in a fire pit outside, but bear", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in mind that can be dangerous. You also need to know about safety", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "procedures for kils as they release toxic compounds into the air. Every potter", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.7718050328064473, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "needs a potter's wheel. This machine is used to shape the clay into an object", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.7717100946992241, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with circular walls or sides such as a bowl. Its invention revolutionized the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.7714351227731195, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pottery industry, allowing multiple items to be produced in a day. Lastly,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "there are a number of different tools that potters use depending on what", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.7720312028545407, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they want to make. When you start, your hands can make all kinds of shapes", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and curves without relying on a sculpting tool. However, there are some", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.7712608303516514, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "basic tools that you will need to handle the clay on the wheel. Some look very", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "strange and have even odd name. themes that you may find hard to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.7714933569468807, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "remember. Rather than go through them all now, I'll just name a few tools as", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we go along. We can provide these, and I wouldn't recommend spending", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "money on them yet. So, let's try making a pot of your own.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.6010637681631926, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}